WEBVTT

00:48.670 --> 00:50.220
<i>This is...</i>

00:57.460 --> 00:59.040
<i>not my house.</i>

01:12.750 --> 01:15.700
<i>Of course there aren't any withdrawals...</i>

01:17.800 --> 01:21.420
<i>I took a year off and still couldn't get 
into any of my top schools.</i>

01:27.040 --> 01:29.570
What is life, anyway?

01:44.610 --> 01:45.450
Huh?!

01:45.450 --> 01:47.460
<b>Dear Hanasaki Rinko,</b>

01:45.450 --> 01:47.460
<b>m 200 120 l 488 178 412 343 118 279</b>

01:45.450 --> 01:47.460
<b>\h\hThis is a message to notify you that you have passed
 the Imperial University entrance exam (make-up).</b>

01:45.450 --> 01:47.460
<b>\h\h\h\hYou will receive a copy of our admission guidelines. 
\hPlease report by the date specified therein
 to fill out your entry paperwork.</b>

01:45.450 --> 01:47.460
<b>\h\h\h\hOnce you have completed the entry paperwork, 
\hyou will be permitted to begin attending classes
 as of April 1st.</b>

01:47.460 --> 01:52.090
<b>Dear Hanasaki Rinko,</b>

01:47.460 --> 01:52.090
<b>\h\h\h\hThis is a message to notify you that you have passed the Imperial University
 entrance exam (make-up).</b>

01:47.460 --> 01:52.090
<b>\h\h\h\h\h\hYou will receive a copy of our admission guidelines. 
Please report by the date specified therein
 to fill out your entry paperwork.</b>

01:47.890 --> 01:49.150
You're kidding...

01:52.470 --> 01:53.960
I did it!

01:54.800 --> 01:56.560
I got in!

02:12.730 --> 02:13.860
<i>Mom...</i>

02:14.690 --> 02:16.150
<i>Onii-chan...</i>

02:16.850 --> 02:17.760
<i>Everyone...</i>

02:18.820 --> 02:21.280
I see a short life in your future.

02:24.260 --> 02:25.650
<i>I get it.</i>

02:28.380 --> 02:31.680
<i>I was fated to die either way.</i>

02:34.130 --> 02:36.760
<i>I, Hanasaki Rinko,</i>

02:37.980 --> 02:40.010
<i>was reborn as Raeliana McMillan...</i>

02:41.150 --> 02:44.430
<i>in the world of a novel.</i>

02:45.860 --> 02:49.400
<i>What the heck is going on?!</i>

04:26.130 --> 04:30.340
<i>Why am I alive? And inside a novel?</i>

04:31.260 --> 04:32.780
<i>That night...</i>

04:34.160 --> 04:36.630
<i>Someone called out to me.</i>

04:37.250 --> 04:39.940
<i>I can't remember their face, their voice,</i>

04:39.940 --> 04:43.650
<i>or even what they said to me.</i>

04:46.760 --> 04:49.780
<i>I woke up in this world.</i>

04:51.260 --> 04:53.620
<i>I don't think I'll ever get used to this.</i>

04:53.620 --> 04:56.550
<i>I can't believe I was reborn 
as someone so beautiful.</i>

04:59.740 --> 05:02.820
My lady, your meal is ready.

05:02.820 --> 05:05.150
Oh... Okay. I'll be right there.

05:11.630 --> 05:12.780
Raeli.

05:12.780 --> 05:14.980
Good day, Father.

05:14.980 --> 05:16.800
Did you sleep well last night?

05:16.800 --> 05:17.650
Yes.

05:20.010 --> 05:21.920
Sister!

05:21.920 --> 05:23.490
Rosemary!

05:23.490 --> 05:24.690
Rose...

05:25.650 --> 05:29.470
Haven't I told you not to 
wander around during meal times?

05:29.470 --> 05:30.900
Now, now.

05:30.900 --> 05:32.700
Let's eat before it gets cold.

05:33.040 --> 05:35.730
You're far too easy on Rose.

05:36.260 --> 05:40.370
Sister, you know what? 
I had a dream I was flying!

05:40.370 --> 05:43.330
<i>We're like the picture-perfect happy family.</i>

05:44.350 --> 05:45.970
So as for the next contract...

05:45.970 --> 05:48.610
<i>Its head, Johndein McMillan,</i>

05:45.970 --> 05:48.620
I think I've got one just about wrapped up.

05:48.610 --> 05:52.750
<i>was granted the title of baron 
for his success in the oil industry.</i>

05:52.560 --> 05:56.680
John, don't talk about work at the table.

05:52.750 --> 05:54.500
<i>He's what they call "nouveau 
riche" among the nobility.</i>

05:56.680 --> 05:58.010
Right, Raeli?

06:01.010 --> 06:03.330
<i>On top of being reborn,</i>

06:04.130 --> 06:08.720
<i>I was blessed with this family 
and a life in which I want for nothing...</i>

06:09.450 --> 06:13.820
<i>aside from the fact that Raeliana 
McMillan is a character in a novel.</i>

06:15.480 --> 06:18.000
<i>Raeliana McMillan is just 
a supporting character.</i>

06:19.430 --> 06:21.370
<i>The heroine of this story is a girl</i>

06:21.370 --> 06:25.250
<i>who returns from studying abroad 
in response to her friend's death...</i>

06:27.980 --> 06:31.910
<i>in other words, Raeliana McMillan's death.</i>

06:34.610 --> 06:37.730
<i>I, Raeliana McMillan...</i>

06:38.610 --> 06:42.400
<i>am going to die soon.</i>

06:47.040 --> 06:48.210
Sister?

06:53.720 --> 06:55.570
<i>I have to die twice?</i>

06:59.520 --> 07:01.500
<i>Over my dead body!</i>

07:05.690 --> 07:09.500
<i>In the novel, the cause of Raeliana's 
death was arsenic poisoning.</i>

07:11.400 --> 07:15.770
<i>Her fiancé mixed it into 
the tea she drank every evening.</i>

07:23.480 --> 07:25.000
Hi there, Raeliana.

07:25.380 --> 07:26.880
<i>Francis Brooks.</i>

07:27.550 --> 07:29.460
<i>He's my fiancé.</i>

07:29.460 --> 07:31.710
Greetings, Lord Brooks.

07:32.200 --> 07:34.170
<i>The one behind it all...</i>

07:39.810 --> 07:42.710
<i>Brooks, a man trusted 
by the McMillan family,</i>

07:42.710 --> 07:45.870
<i>wins over Raeliana's parents 
when they're heartbroken over her death</i>

07:45.870 --> 07:47.690
<i>and tries to take over the family business.</i>

07:49.450 --> 07:52.870
<i>That's when the heroine of the story appears</i>

07:52.870 --> 07:54.650
<i>and exposes the truth of what happened.</i>

07:55.010 --> 07:57.640
<i>At least, that's how it goes in the novel...</i>

07:58.610 --> 08:01.850
<i>But if it gets that far, 
I'll already be dead.</i>

08:02.290 --> 08:04.720
It's such lovely weather today.

08:04.970 --> 08:06.820
Shall we walk through the garden?

08:08.200 --> 08:09.220
Of course.

08:10.160 --> 08:12.250
<i>The engagement was agreed 
upon by both families.</i>

08:12.250 --> 08:14.980
<i>The Brooks family is 
a long-standing noble household,</i>

08:14.980 --> 08:17.920
<i>so I can't just call it off on my own.</i>

08:18.990 --> 08:22.090
<i>And even if I told anyone 
that he's trying to kill me,</i>

08:22.090 --> 08:23.550
<i>no one would believe me.</i>

08:24.000 --> 08:26.320
<i>Which means there's only one thing to do...</i>

08:27.190 --> 08:30.440
<i>I have to make him want to 
dissolve our engagement.</i>

08:32.940 --> 08:34.070
Raeliana?

08:34.840 --> 08:36.960
We should break up.

08:38.550 --> 08:40.450
Look at that crow.

08:40.450 --> 08:42.260
I want to break up with you.

08:42.260 --> 08:44.330
What a silly-looking crow!

08:44.330 --> 08:46.950
Hello? Are you listening to me?

08:46.060 --> 08:49.920
Wait, isn't that a hawk? How unusual!

08:52.100 --> 08:53.930
<i>Why did I think that would work?</i>

08:54.640 --> 08:57.260
<i>I need to come up with a better plan.</i>

08:55.720 --> 08:58.430
<b>The How to Cleanly Break Up
 with Your Boyfriend 
Top 50

</b>

08:55.720 --> 08:58.430
<b>"I want a break-up that won't cause further issues!" {top left}</b>

08:55.720 --> 08:58.430
<b>"I want to break up right now!" {middle right}</b>

08:55.720 --> 08:58.430
<b>"I won't just take this anymore!" {bottom}</b>

08:55.720 --> 08:58.430
<b>A relationship columnist explains the best
 break-up methods for all types!</b>

09:04.130 --> 09:06.290
Oh, dear. I'm sorry.

09:08.440 --> 09:10.600
My hand slipped.

09:10.890 --> 09:13.940
I've ruined your precious clothes.

09:14.240 --> 09:16.810
No... It's fine.

09:19.820 --> 09:22.250
Look! There's a piano over there!

09:22.830 --> 09:26.280
I would love to hear you play, Lord Brooks.

09:27.280 --> 09:28.830
With pleasure.

09:29.450 --> 09:31.650
If it is your wish...

09:34.620 --> 09:36.940
I'm sorry. Please excuse me for a moment.

09:37.540 --> 09:38.520
Raeliana?

09:38.520 --> 09:39.580
<i>Victory!</i>

09:40.660 --> 09:43.600
<i>Why won't he say anything?!</i>

09:43.600 --> 09:45.440
<i>I even read a book for this!</i>

09:46.100 --> 09:49.100
<b>The How to Cleanly Break Up
 with Your Boyfriend 
Top 50</b>

09:46.100 --> 09:49.100
<b>"I want a break-up that won't cause further issues!" {top left}</b>

09:46.100 --> 09:49.100
<b>"I want to break up right now!" {middle right}</b>

09:46.100 --> 09:49.100
<b>"I won't just take this anymore!" {bottom}</b>

09:46.100 --> 09:49.100
<b>A relationship columnist explains the best
 break-up methods for all types!</b>

09:46.100 --> 09:49.100
<i>What is going on?!</i>

09:49.890 --> 09:51.890
<i>Third time's the charm.</i>

09:51.890 --> 09:54.900
<i>This time, I'll make it work!</i>

09:56.110 --> 09:58.010
This is your first hunt, isn't it?

09:58.010 --> 09:59.870
Do you know how to hold a gun?

09:59.870 --> 10:01.730
<i>How little you know, Brooks.</i>

10:01.730 --> 10:04.370
<i>As far back as I can remember,</i>

10:04.370 --> 10:08.450
<i>I grew up watching my father, 
Johndein McMillan, go hunting.</i>

10:09.160 --> 10:13.120
It's my first time holding a gun. 
I hope I'm doing it right.

10:13.630 --> 10:14.370
Aim carefu—

10:16.090 --> 10:19.220
Oh, dear, I'm sorry! I'm still new to this.

10:20.000 --> 10:25.140
<i>After all this, surely even he'll 
get sick of me and want to break up...</i>

10:26.800 --> 10:28.160
<i>He didn't!</i>

10:28.890 --> 10:32.030
<i>What is going on?!</i>

10:32.650 --> 10:34.720
Good day, Raeliana.

10:35.010 --> 10:36.440
What brings you here?

10:36.690 --> 10:39.730
We made no prior plans to meet today.

10:40.050 --> 10:42.190
Prior plans?

10:42.190 --> 10:46.390
Raeliana, you and I are engaged, are we not?

10:47.390 --> 10:50.530
Even in a close relationship, 
manners are still important.

10:51.410 --> 10:53.700
Please return home today.

10:53.930 --> 10:54.830
Raeliana!

10:56.520 --> 10:58.120
What are you doing?!

10:58.120 --> 11:00.220
Why are you suddenly talking like that?!

11:00.670 --> 11:02.180
Even if this is a political marriage,

11:02.180 --> 11:05.410
I thought we had a deeper relationship!

11:05.410 --> 11:08.480
Or was I the only one who felt that way?!

11:09.810 --> 11:13.360
Yes, you were mistaken, Lord Brooks.

11:13.760 --> 11:16.860
So please let go of me now.

11:20.210 --> 11:24.940
What the McMillan family wants is 
the Brooks family's social standing!

11:25.770 --> 11:32.420
They should be grateful to me for 
agreeing to marry a nouveau riche like you.

11:32.420 --> 11:34.160
Wh-What did you say?

11:34.500 --> 11:39.300
However you may fight it, 
you can't escape this marriage.

11:40.370 --> 11:44.740
You'd best prepare yourself 
to obediently serve your future husband.

11:48.570 --> 11:50.180
<i>That guy...</i>

11:52.180 --> 11:55.150
<i>I wish I could just kill 
him myself, right now!</i>

12:01.810 --> 12:04.950
<i>I already live in 
a world I barely understand.</i>

12:04.950 --> 12:09.670
<i>I refuse to spend every 
day here living in fear!</i>

12:14.850 --> 12:17.830
<i>I'll have to think of some other way...</i>

12:25.080 --> 12:27.220
<i>So he finally shows up.</i>

12:27.750 --> 12:29.880
<i>Noah Voltaire Wynknight...</i>

12:30.520 --> 12:32.530
<i>A duke of this nation,</i>

12:33.760 --> 12:36.050
<i>and the protagonist of the novel.</i>

12:49.780 --> 12:52.890
<i>In the Kingdom of Chamus, where I live now,</i>

12:52.890 --> 12:57.490
<i>royal authority has decayed 
significantly with the rise of capitalism.</i>

12:58.390 --> 13:03.310
<i>The old nobles came up with a law 
to pluck new nobles out from the root</i>

13:03.310 --> 13:04.910
<i>before they can acquire any power.</i>

13:08.980 --> 13:11.200
<i>The transfer of noble ranks is forbidden.</i>

13:10.970 --> 13:14.310
<b>Known as the "Nouveau Riche Prevention Law"</b>

13:11.200 --> 13:13.540
<i>They call it the "Nouveau 
Riche Prevention Law."</i>

13:14.570 --> 13:17.850
<i>But the royal seal they 
needed to enact that law</i>

13:17.850 --> 13:20.090
<i>was stolen by someone.</i>

13:20.690 --> 13:26.340
<i>As the old nobles were scrambling to come up 
with a new way to suppress the nouveau riche,</i>

13:26.340 --> 13:28.700
<i>the one who showed up out of 
nowhere like a comet...</i>

13:29.410 --> 13:31.550
<i>was the younger brother of the current king</i>

13:31.550 --> 13:35.810
<i>and first in line for the throne, 
Noah Voltaire, simply known as "Noah."</i>

13:37.030 --> 13:38.460
<i>The Wynknight family has been the core</i>

13:38.470 --> 13:40.560
<i>of the kingdom's military 
strength for generations,</i>

13:40.560 --> 13:42.610
<i>and he is the former queen's eldest son.</i>

13:42.960 --> 13:45.170
<i>He's basically the last bastion 
for conservatism.</i>

13:45.800 --> 13:47.540
<i>Though he was removed from</i>

13:47.540 --> 13:50.600
<i>the line of succession at one time 
due to an unfortunate scandal,</i>

13:50.600 --> 13:52.900
<i>he's now known as the young ace</i>

13:52.900 --> 13:58.100
<i>who'll take center stage again 
and carry the hopes of the old nobles.</i>

13:58.540 --> 14:00.160
<i>He must have it rough.</i>

14:00.650 --> 14:02.600
<i>But... wait a minute...</i>

14:03.700 --> 14:05.610
<i>Since his rank is higher,</i>

14:05.610 --> 14:07.660
<i>maybe he could stop Brooks...</i>

14:08.810 --> 14:12.410
<i>If this works out, it could be 
an incredible bargaining chip.</i>

14:18.880 --> 14:23.250
<i>I know that guy, 
and I know this story's ending.</i>

14:26.230 --> 14:30.150
<i>This is stuff that only someone who came 
from outside this world could know.</i>

14:32.210 --> 14:36.190
<i>I don't know if something like this will 
work on a pure-blooded noble, but...</i>

14:37.130 --> 14:38.770
Excuse me for a moment.

14:40.960 --> 14:42.550
<i>It's do or die.</i>

14:44.670 --> 14:46.540
<i>It's worth a try, at least.</i>

14:48.680 --> 14:50.400
Well, well!

14:51.440 --> 14:54.030
If it isn't Francis Brooks.

14:54.350 --> 14:56.290
Jake Langston...

14:56.810 --> 14:59.160
It's been a while, Brooks.

15:00.290 --> 15:02.280
One moment, please.

15:03.470 --> 15:06.470
You sure you should leave your 
cute little fiancée all alone?

15:06.470 --> 15:08.250
That's none of your business!

15:08.660 --> 15:10.930
Don't be so aloof.

15:11.270 --> 15:14.180
We're both in the same boat, aren't we?

15:14.180 --> 15:16.760
It's only natural that I'd worry.

15:16.760 --> 15:19.280
There's nothing for you to worry about!

15:19.280 --> 15:19.990
So just go—

15:19.990 --> 15:21.810
Even our client has told me

15:21.810 --> 15:25.530
that you and your fiancée haven't 
been getting along well lately.

15:27.770 --> 15:30.770
Let me just give you one little warning.

15:31.670 --> 15:33.520
Do your job.

15:35.400 --> 15:38.790
If you screw this up, you're dead.

15:40.780 --> 15:44.930
So yeah, do your best not to 
make your fiancée get tired of you.

15:47.310 --> 15:51.170
<i>This is all that woman's fault!</i>

15:51.190 --> 15:53.710
<i>I thought she was a shy girl...</i>

15:54.720 --> 15:58.110
<i>but recently, she's changed completely!</i>

15:58.690 --> 16:02.720
You there. Have you seen Lady Raeliana?

16:02.720 --> 16:03.450
Yeah.

16:03.450 --> 16:06.300
I saw her walking toward the garden.

16:06.300 --> 16:07.470
I see.

16:08.670 --> 16:11.940
<i>I swear... She is such a headache!</i>

16:18.200 --> 16:21.730
<i>I followed him out here 
without even thinking.</i>

16:21.730 --> 16:23.880
<i>What do I say to him?</i>

16:24.580 --> 16:27.500
<i>And... he's obviously 
suspicious already, isn't he?</i>

16:27.500 --> 16:30.340
<i>It's not as if we have any mutual friends.</i>

16:31.640 --> 16:35.860
<i>And this is my first time speaking 
to a noble I've never met—</i>

16:35.860 --> 16:37.470
Do you have some business with me?

16:42.980 --> 16:46.740
Duke, this is my first time meeting you.

16:46.740 --> 16:48.960
I am the daughter 
of Baron Johndein McMillan.

16:48.960 --> 16:51.110
My name is Raeliana McMillan.

16:51.110 --> 16:53.970
Ah, the young lady of the McMillan family.

16:53.970 --> 16:56.370
I am Noah Voltaire Wynknight.

16:58.750 --> 17:01.200
<i>Wait, why am I just gawking at him?!</i>

17:01.200 --> 17:04.500
<i>I can't be deceived 
by the sweet mask this man wears!</i>

17:05.480 --> 17:06.930
If I may be so bold,

17:06.930 --> 17:09.860
I have come in hopes 
of making a deal with you.

17:11.360 --> 17:12.630
A deal?

17:13.170 --> 17:16.580
<i>I know who this guy really is.</i>

17:18.430 --> 17:22.930
I don't know if this is 
something I should say here...

17:25.770 --> 17:28.430
It's about the royal seal.

17:34.280 --> 17:37.680
<i>Behind that calm, angelic smile</i>

17:38.220 --> 17:40.550
<i>lurks a terrible demon.</i>

17:41.300 --> 17:43.780
Oh? Well...

17:44.630 --> 17:47.140
How very intriguing...

17:48.130 --> 17:50.050
<i>Two-faced bastard!</i>

17:53.680 --> 17:55.640
Why don't you tell me

17:56.880 --> 17:58.910
all the details of this deal of yours?

17:59.510 --> 18:02.400
<i>He's on board! Now I can...</i>

18:03.380 --> 18:04.140
Raeliana?

18:07.150 --> 18:09.060
<i>Of all the times...</i>

18:09.060 --> 18:12.280
<i>Must he get in my way at every single step?!</i>

18:12.980 --> 18:14.780
<i>What should I do?</i>

18:15.880 --> 18:18.520
<i>Wait for the next opportunity?</i>

18:20.370 --> 18:21.380
<i>Actually...</i>

18:22.100 --> 18:23.880
<i>This might be my best opportunity!</i>

18:31.600 --> 18:35.420
I suppose I can't keep it hidden any longer.

18:36.480 --> 18:39.360
Lord Brooks, I'm very sorry.

18:39.360 --> 18:41.190
F-For what?

18:43.240 --> 18:44.560
It would seem...

18:44.980 --> 18:49.810
that the Duke and I have 
grown fond of each other.

18:51.670 --> 18:52.980
What?

18:57.960 --> 19:00.090
The royal seal...

19:11.700 --> 19:14.680
<i>He actually... picked up on that?</i>

19:15.090 --> 19:17.860
Wh-What in the world is...

19:16.420 --> 19:19.220
Lady Raeliana! Where are you?

19:19.560 --> 19:20.870
Right here!

19:21.270 --> 19:22.690
<i>Lucky break!</i>

19:23.380 --> 19:26.530
Well, I must take my leave now.

19:26.970 --> 19:28.920
Please have a wonderful evening.

19:30.820 --> 19:32.220
Wait!

19:33.730 --> 19:35.880
Is what you just said true?

19:36.610 --> 19:38.630
<i>I swear, this guy...</i>

19:39.980 --> 19:41.600
Yes, it's true.

19:41.600 --> 19:46.080
As I've said many times before, 
I'd like to call off our engagement.

19:46.080 --> 19:47.280
But why now?!

19:47.820 --> 19:51.780
It's quite late already. May I leave now?

19:52.200 --> 19:54.790
You lowly nouveau riche!

19:54.790 --> 19:57.410
You want to call off our engagement?!

19:57.410 --> 20:00.300
Do you really think you have the right to—

20:00.550 --> 20:01.720
That's enough.

20:03.990 --> 20:05.860
Take her home.

20:05.860 --> 20:07.010
O-Of course.

20:07.680 --> 20:08.980
Come, my lady.

20:08.980 --> 20:12.210
If we're home too late, 
the baron will scold me.

20:12.210 --> 20:14.130
Yes. I'm sorry.

20:19.520 --> 20:23.970
<i>It had to be Noah Voltaire Wynknight,
 of all people?!</i>

20:25.070 --> 20:28.520
Even if you are a duke, 
this is just too much!

20:29.240 --> 20:32.710
That girl is <i>my</i> fiancée!

20:32.710 --> 20:35.190
Did you not hear what she said?

20:39.120 --> 20:44.220
I don't believe you have the right 
to call yourself her fiancé anymore.

20:47.320 --> 20:48.880
I'm not the type...

20:48.880 --> 20:52.210
who'll just sit quietly and let this happen.

20:56.320 --> 20:57.240
Whitton...

20:57.570 --> 20:58.280
Yes?

20:58.280 --> 21:00.730
Investigate Raeliana McMillan.

21:00.730 --> 21:03.210
And assign someone to watch that man,

21:03.210 --> 21:06.500
so that we can act quickly 
in case he tries anything.

21:06.500 --> 21:08.560
Understood, Your Grace.

21:10.740 --> 21:12.200
<i>A deal?</i>

21:13.210 --> 21:14.880
<i>With me?</i>

21:21.730 --> 21:23.140
My lady?!

21:23.950 --> 21:26.260
Raeli, what's wrong?

21:29.010 --> 21:30.360
I'm all right.

21:30.360 --> 21:32.960
The night breeze just gave me a chill.

21:33.290 --> 21:35.180
Well, that won't do.

21:35.180 --> 21:37.450
Wear this coat over your dress.

21:37.450 --> 21:40.060
Thank you, Father.

21:41.920 --> 21:46.080
<i>Did I really do the right thing?</i>

21:47.740 --> 21:50.400
You are returning awfully late.

21:55.200 --> 21:56.460
Yes.

21:57.380 --> 22:00.520
I encountered a puppy on my way home.

22:15.680 --> 22:19.030
<i>I see a short life in your future.</i>

22:20.030 --> 22:23.870
<i>I refuse to die twice!</i>

23:35.010 --> 23:40.020
<b>Episode Two</b>

23:35.010 --> 23:40.020
<b>Why Raeliana Made a Contract</b>
